 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Specialization stability inside the boundary complement",
 "statement": "The image of $U_i$ in\n$U\\times_S(X_i\\setminus\\overline Z_{i,j})$ is stable under specialization.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-nagata-compactification/sk-thm-nagata-sketch-two-open/lemma-nagata-intermediate-overlap-specialization-closed.md",
